    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n981" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγῠρ-ις</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>, ἡ, 
			Aeol.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγορά</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>gathering, crowd</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρῶν ἄγυριν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					3.31
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν νεκύων ἀγύρει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.661
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν νηῶν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					24.141
				</span></i>
			; also in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				753
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παμπληθὴς ἄ.</span>
			Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Phleg.
				<u>Macr.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>gathering</i> of herbs, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>L.</u>
				416
			</span></i>.</div>
